[ti:Money-Drags Us]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Classical & Raga]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]हर बार की कहानी में..
[00:11.58]क्या नया है जो सुनाए..
[00:15.17]प्यार बहुत होता है..
[00:18.75]जब तक पैसा बीच ना आए..
[00:22.33]Same story every time..
[00:25.91]What's new left to say?
[00:29.50]Love is easy, love is full..
[00:33.08]Till money finds its way.
[00:36.66]ना मैं सही ना तू गलत..
[00:40.24]सबको सिर्फ समय चलाए..
[00:43.83]I'm not right, you're not wrong..
[00:47.41]Time just drags us all along.
[00:50.99]क्या सच है क्या झूठ है..
[00:54.57]What is truth? What is a lie?
[00:58.16]Everyone decides what keeps them alive.
[01:01.74]जाने टूटे दिलों के टुकड़े..
[01:05.32]किसी और के आने से फिर जुड़ जाए..
[01:08.90]Broken hearts don't stay that way..
[01:12.49]Someone new walks in one day.
[01:16.07]Male: फिर धड़के दिल के तार..
[01:19.65]Female: The strings inside just start to play..
[01:23.23]Both: And love happens anyway.. फिर से प्यार यूं ही हो जाए..
[01:26.82]Male: लगा रह दिल किनारे से..
[01:30.40]Female: Heart stays anchored to the shore..
[01:33.98]Male: जाने कब तेरे नाम की लहर कब आ जाए..
[01:37.57]Female: Waiting for your name.. a wave I've never seen before..
[01:41.15]Male: मत हो उदास ए दिल..
[01:44.73]ये खास नहीं है बात..
[01:48.31]Female: Don't be sad, heart..
[01:51.90]This isn't special. This isn't new.
[01:55.48]Male: आएगा फिर सैलाब हार्मोन्स का..
[01:59.06]Female: The flood will come again.. chemicals, waves, something true..
[02:02.64]Both unison: तू रख पिया मिलन की आस..
[02:06.23]Female echo: keep the hope, keep the meeting, keep the you..
[02:09.81]Male: तू भी टूटा है..
[02:13.39]Female: Yes.
[02:16.97]Female: तू भी रोया है..
[02:20.56]Male: Yes.
[02:24.14]Male: फिर क्यों अकेले..
[02:27.72]Female: [echo] फिर क्यों अकेले..
[02:31.30]Both unison: बाँट लें दर्द..
[02:34.89]Cycle 1 – both unison, soft: आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ
[02:38.47]Cycle 2 – female only, high: आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ
[02:42.05]Cycle 3 – male only, chest: आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ
[02:45.63]Cycle 4 – both unison, slowing: आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ आ (last आ held 4 seconds)
[02:49.22]आएगा..
